          "maximum": 9007199254740991,
          "minimum": -9007199254740991,
          "type": "integer"
         },
         {
          "type": "null"
         }
        ],
        "description": "Asking price in EUR (per month for rent). null = the number in the ad is NOT the price of the whole property \u2014 see priceNote; never quote one."
       },
       "priceHistory": {
        "description": "Prices LivinIsto has seen for this listing, oldest first (only when the price is a real price).",
